With [[milestones]], only the milestone named launch needs a deployment or
hosting ticket: staging-proven has none either, and is not warned about.

-- ajiya.toml --
[project]
name = "Fixture"
prefix = "FX"

[[milestones]]
name = "staging-proven"
targets = ["FX-0001"]

[[milestones]]
name = "launch"
targets = ["FX-0002"]
-- ajiya/core.md --
<!-- Written by ajiya. Do not edit by hand: use ajiya commands. -->
# Core

Goal: g

| ID | App | Ticket | Done when | Depends | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| FX-0001 | infra | Write the API | a | - | 🟥 Pending |
| FX-0002 | infra | Write the docs | b | FX-0001 | 🟥 Pending |
-- want --
W007 ajiya.toml: nothing required for launch mentions deployment or hosting. Fix: add a ticket for deployment or hosting that the launch target depends on
